                "id": "Xy0Kz6M7gabxyM108SlT",
                "prompt": "A very old Irish monk voice, speaking English with a warm, lilting Irish accent — a gentle, frail-sounding ninety-year-old with a twinkle in his eye. Soft, crackly and unhurried, kind and soothing, with sudden dry wit. Lovable and funny, never booming, never grim, never a caricature. Perfect audio quality.",
